Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:19.03,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,konna koto ii na   dekitara ii na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:19.03,OPtl,,0,0,0,,I wish I had this...   I wish I could do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:24.54,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,anna yume konna yume  ippai aru kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:24.54,OPtl,,0,0,0,,This kind of dream, that kind of dream... There are lots of kinds, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:28.54,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,minna minna minna   kanaete kureru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:28.54,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Each and every one of them can come true!
