Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:33.40,OPtl,,0,0,0,,With his mysterious pocket, he'll make all your dreams come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:37.97,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,sora wo jiyuu ni tobitai na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:37.97,OPtl,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like to fly about freely in the sky...
