Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:48.98,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh... I love you so much, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:56.74,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,an an an  tottemo daisuki Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:56.74,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh... I love you so much, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:17.06,Title,,0,0,0,,The Time Cloth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}"The Time Cloth!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:27.58,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be2}We, Team Nothing Better to Do, have taken over your pathetic preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:29.58,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}That's enough from you,\NTeam Nothing Better to Do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:35.13,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Who the heck are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:38.09,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I am the Space Sergeant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wonder if it's gonna die yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I think it's about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.15,0:02:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It finally broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hey, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Mom! The TV broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.37,0:02:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Let's jump at this chance and go buy a new one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.01,0:02:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}A {\i1}really {\i0}big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:29.31,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Augh, that hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I found out lately that it'll still work once you hit it around here at about a 60 degree angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Oh... I wonder if we'll need to buy\Na new one of these pretty soon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Uh, oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:02:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(686.792,688.5)\be2}Oh, Honey~!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:02:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Um, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Perfect timing. I'm thinking\Nabout getting a new camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Our washer's more important\Nthan something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Our washer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It still works, so isn't it fine for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.14,0:03:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Oh! Uh, well... New ones\Nhave all these nice features and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:15.48,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Here's my finishing move...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, there it goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2\i1}Come on...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}If you hit it, it works for a little while, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Again...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Come on, that TV {\i1}really {\i0} doesn't work anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}A camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}A washer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}The shutter on this one\Ndoesn't work right anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}We have laundry that needs\Nwashed everyday, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I need to be able to take pictures when I want to! They become special memories, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Looks like a new TV's out of the question right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, well. Let's fix the one we have now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What? You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Of course! Let's see here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:58.63,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\q2\alpha&H80&\blur30.094\fs300\t(0,375,\alpha&H00&\blur0\bord3\fs97.5)\t(375,550,\fs105)\c&H4795DA&\3c&H1F5366&\pos(652.075,510)}Time Cloth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Because we have the Time Cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Just watch! We wrap it in this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And voilà!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wow! It's like it's brand new!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}That's because it goes back to\N how it used to be when you wrap it in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hey, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\q0}I'll fix the washer for Mom, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, no! You've got it inside out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What?! It's all worn out and beat up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}That's because things get older if you put it on backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And... That should do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}What happened to our washer?!\NIt sparkles just like the day we bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}What do you think? Pretty \Nawesome that it's just like new, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}This sure is a handy cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}I know! How about we gather up\Neveryone's old stuff they don't need...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Oh, I get it! If we make it all\Nnew again with the Time Cloth...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}We can get toys or {\i1}anything {\i0}for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}If you have any old stuff you don't need, can we have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What are you going to do with all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, just something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Suneo-kun's family is rich, so I think they'd have {\i1}lots{\i0} of old stuff they don't need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Well, yeah. We only like the\Nabsolute newest stuff, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}If you have things you don't\Nneed anymore, can we have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What're you gonna do with stuff like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.23,0:05:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Its... a... secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.13,0:05:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I can't tell you, Suneo-kun, because you're so stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}If I told you how we're going to make it all new again with the Time Cloth...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You'll just take everything back, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}That's why I won't tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You're telling me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}We've gathered it all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Doraemon, hurry and use the Time Cloth on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Okay~!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Whoa! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hey... We've made it all new, but there are things here we don't want, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What if we sold those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}But I don't know about\Nselling stuff we got for free...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}If we made a profit, you\Ncould buy some dorayaki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}D-D-Dorayaki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I wonder how many I could buy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I don't know... Maybe 10 or 20?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}20 of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Then, then... If we gathered up more stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Then you could buy more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And if we gathered up even more than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Then you could buy even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Then if we gathered up\Nmore and more and more...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You could buy as many as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Whoa! As many as I like?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Then let's get more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Let's gather up piles, and heaps,\Ntruckloads, and {\i1}mountains{\i0} of stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I'm borrowing this for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:21.77,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Gouda General Store
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yo, Suneo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wut is it? I'm helpin' ma' Ma now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Hey, I'd like to have any old junk\Nyou don't need anymore, if you have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}This really {\i1}IS {\i0}a bunch of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Did ya' say sumthin' just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ah, no! Just thanking you for your generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}'Ey, Suneo. Wutcha gonna do wid dat stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's... a... secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}If I told Gian, he'd cause so much trouble. He's bossy and greedy, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wut was dat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Fine, I'll tell you! I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Gather up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Listen up! It dun matter wut\Nit is, jus bring your old junk 'ere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Now, move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And make it snappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yer gonna do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ya' gotta problem wid dat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Den get yer butt goin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.35,0:08:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Bring me back a lotta stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}That's why I don't like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.73,0:08:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Wit dis, I dun need ta' worry\N'bout my allowance no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}What're you doing?\NDidn't I tell you to help run the store?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Ma, waitta sec! I can makka\Nkiller profit right now! Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Come on, I'm not half asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Go deliver these eggs to Yamada-san's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Kinda dangerous, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Since you've got a cloth there,\Nwrap them up with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wut?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wit dis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Don't be so slow! Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hurry and get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Will dese really be okay...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Augh! Why'd I haffa open my big mouth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wait! Wait, li'l chicks! Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}The Time Cloth's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I hung it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Someone must've taken it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What's with Gian?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Everyone brought their junk, just like he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Where'd he go?\NAnd what do we do with all this now...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Is that...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's the Time Cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I'm not gonna let you get it that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}This time, it's mine for sure...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Huh? Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ah! How could this happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Please, give an old man a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Where do you think {\i1}you two {\i0} are  going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:11:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Alright! Dere it is! Dere it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I'm not gonna let'cha git away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's mine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Give that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wait, Suneo! Give that cloth back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}No fair, Suneo! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Suneo, give back my Time Cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And what might you need? Your incessant pounding is just driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, my! My Sune-chama did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, how embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Please wait here a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, my! I did not know it was such an amazing cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}But you must return other people's belongings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}But I think I shall use it\Nonce before returning it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}No fair, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I shall make this alligator skin handbag new again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}All that is required is to\Ndrape the cloth over it, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It is {\i1}TOO {\i0} new!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:13.00,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\be2\fad(0,0)\pos(952.453,519)\c&H8BA6B6&\clip(m 300.377 201 l 285.283 376.5 1024.906 379.5 999.245 237 889.057 222)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 1464.151 0 1464.151 337.5 0 337.5{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAnna\fs157.5\bord6\3a&H00&\shad0\fscx102\c&HBA7200&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(649.057,370.5)}Mini {\c&HC08AE7&}Theater
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Nobita-kun, let's play with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What do we do with a rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Let's make it into the shape of a horse...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}That looks weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Huh? W-Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And it'll start to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Giddy up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.03,0:12:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Lettus try it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.87,0:12:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Alright! I'mma gonna make a snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}We got ate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's a make-believe train!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.05,0:13:01.97,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&H82EDE0&}The Dandelions Fly Off into The Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:13:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}The Dandelions Fly Off into The Sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wow, that sure surprised me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh? What did?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}This thing here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Look! Inside the case where you were keeping the rhinoceros beetle last year...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's a dandelion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}A seed must have got blown into the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Okay, I'll go throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hey, w-wait... Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}How could you possibly say something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Cold heartedly taking the life of\Na flower that worked so hard to make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Don't exaggerate...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's just a dandelion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Now you listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Even a weed or the smallest bug has feelings, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You've gotta have a loving heart towards them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Then that heart will begin\Nto commune with nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}And they'll be able to\Nflourish and enrich humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Didn't think you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}So let's try...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:14:00.40,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\q2\alpha&H80&\blur30.094\fs300\t(0,375,\alpha&H00&\blur0\bord3\fs97.5)\t(375,550,\3a&H20&\fs105)\c&H66D983&\3c&H4D5736&\pos(652.075,540)}Fantasy Glasses
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:14:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}The Fantasy Glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Here. Go ahead and put them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Now take a look at the dandelion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ah, it's crying! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}That's because you said\Nyou were going to throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}When you put on those Fantasy Glasses...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}They personify plants and animals like in fantasy novels and fairy tales, making humans be able to see and understand their emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}How mysterious...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I'm sorry. Please don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I won't say I'm going to throw you away anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I know! I'll go replant you in the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}There. I'll plant you right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Excuse me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}If possible, could you put me in a sunnier place...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I-It spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Things can talk to you while you're\Nwearing the Fantasy Glasses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}They can?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Thank you for being so kind to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}No, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Aw, that must be nice.\NThat dandelion's getting all the attention...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}I'm so thirsty...\NAren't you thirsty, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}So thirsty...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.52,0:15:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yeah, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Me, too... Please, give me some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It doesn't rain over here, and I can't last much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I couldn't possibly ignore them after they say all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Don't just watch, come and help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I can't hear {\i1}anything{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Wow, Nobita's watering the plants?\NYou don't see that everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}That lazy, good-for-nothing\NNobita's {\i1}actually{\i0} watering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Next we'll see pigs flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Even the cats made fun of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}They're not really speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}The glasses are just making the putting your heart's innermost thoughts into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:15:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Man, I'm done with these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's best not to think about things too deeply, and only put them on to play once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Who needs them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Doraemon must be hiding\Ndorayaki in the closet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Okay, I'll try looking at them with the glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Work! Work! Because if we're being lazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}We'll regret it when winter comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And we don't want to be like Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.59,0:16:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ah! Even the ants made fun of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Nobita's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2\i1}Actually {\i0}studying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I wonder what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:16:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.84,0:17:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Thank you, Nobita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Everyone's happy now, right? No more complaints?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Thank you for the delicious water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You're getting all thick and full of buds, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}'Ey, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}We came to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's Gian and Suneo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Nobita! Yer on our baseball team,\Nso hurry up 'n get out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.01,0:17:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}We're taking the time to invite\Nsomeone who sucks as much as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}So you better be grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Like I'd go with them!\NIf they lose, they'll just say it was my fault, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.34,0:17:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Are you bad at baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hey, Gian. It's getting late, so let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yer right. We'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}If you're bad at it...\NYou just have to try that much harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Be quiet! Don't say such ignorant things!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh, no! The dandelion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.23,0:18:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ah! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.01,0:18:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Nobita-san...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}That's great! You bloomed so beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It's all thanks to you, Nobita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}You planted me in such a good spot,\Nand protected me from the storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You're a really kind, reliable boy, Nobita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}No, you're just saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}It was nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:18:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Dora-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:19:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Nobita's been talking to himself\Na lot lately. I'm worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Nobita-kun, why don't you go out and play some baseball once in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Or do something that'll\Nreally get your body moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}I'm making it a point not to\Ndo things I'm not confident in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Then... What {\i1}are {\i0}you confident in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Nobita! Yer definitely gonna\Ncome play baseball wit us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.05,0:19:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You're awful if you refuse again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}We'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Humans are so rude and violent...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Plants, on the other hand...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Wow, what a nice hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:20:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}These are my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.01,0:20:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Pretty soon, they'll all take a journey\Nout into the vastness of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.59,0:20:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Oh look, a breeze is coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Bye, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}No! I wanna be with you forever, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You mustn't say things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}But I'm scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You can't run away just because you're scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Your brothers and sisters all gathered up their courage and flew off, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Come on, little one. You can do it!\NCatch the next breeze that comes along, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.79,0:20:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\be2}I don't wanna! I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}What, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}That's right, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Your Mommy came flying in here on a breeze, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Where from? Where was your Mommy planted, Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:21:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2\fad(0,500)}She was on a train platform\Ndeep in a far, far away mountain...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}One sunny day, my many brothers and sisters and I all flitted off, up into the never-ending sky together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.49,0:21:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Weren't you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Not one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.61,0:21:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}I had been looking forward to\Nmy first journey out into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}When I got tired, I hitched a ride on the roof of a train...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(0,500)}And listened to the sound of it chugging along as I let it rock me into a peaceful afternoon nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}When night came, I did get lonely and cry a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.47,0:21:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}But I always had the moon to comfort me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}And you know... I still remember\Nwhen I first saw the sea, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}The sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.09,0:21:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}It was so big and blue...\NAnd the glistening waves were so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Then I finally made it to this town...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.18,0:21:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And got blown into Nobita-san's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.97,0:22:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Are you glad you went on your jounrey, Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yes, of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}After all... It was thanks to that, that I was able to blossom into a beautiful flower...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}And give birth to all my little ones, whom I love so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.47,0:22:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.24,0:22:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Tomorrow, I'm going to go on a journey, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.49,0:22:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.05,0:22:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I just got real sleepy for some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Then, how about I sing you a lullabye?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Hey! Little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.20,0:22:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.66,0:23:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Yep! It's not as scary as I thought it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.33,0:23:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}But where are you planning to go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.13,0:23:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}The world's so big... There might be lots of scary places out there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.73,0:23:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}But I'll gather up my courage, and try to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.15,0:23:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Then I'll be able to blossom into\Na beautiful flower, somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.87,0:23:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}Nobita-san, tell my Mommy\Nnot to worry about me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.04,0:23:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.25,0:23:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.10,0:23:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Take care, okay! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}All right, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}Ya' better hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.35,0:23:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\be2}This is our chance to have\Na good winning percentage!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.71,0:23:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be2}I guess I'll try joining in.
